        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "第四种叫射：指山势笔直而来，尖峰直射向冢宅。或是像拖枪，或是像悬刀，或是像虬尾。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
